  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>In the heart of central Toulon, Feel Food serves local, healthy cuisine (plenty of produce from the Var), rated by Petit Futé as 100% vegetarian/vegan/gluten-free, with a terrace set on a quiet, shaded square. The reviews are excellent and consistent: 9.6/10 on TheFork and 5/5 across 60 reviews.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>Several independent directories specifically mention that dogs are allowed on the terrace, including BringFido, which confirms a pet-friendly outdoor table — an extra signal on top of the sources already known. This information comes up consistently across several platforms, with the same precise detail (terrace only, not the dining room) — but none of it comes from an official statement by the establishment itself (website, social media). As always in this kind of case, take it as a good sign rather than a guarantee. Note the tight hours: closed Sunday and Monday, service running until 11:30pm on Fridays only.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: call ahead if you want to be 100% sure, especially on a busy evening — the number is right there.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Central Toulon and its pedestrian streets are directly accessible on foot from the restaurant.</p>
